    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d41">

                <pb facs="0107" n="57" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg57"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Thompson to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-18"><hi rendition="#italic">April 18,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Thompson telegraphs that according to intelligence received from the south
                    the revolutionary cause has been abandoned by Admiral Mello, who has gone with
                    1,200 men and 4 vessels of the revolting squadron to the Argentine Republic,
                    which gives them protection. The sinking of the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Aqnidaban</hi> and the complete overthrow of the revolutionary movement are
                    announced.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
